  Hosted app + this computer
  Opens http://127.0.0.1:7001. https://app.bonsai.dev also works while bonsai
  web runs.

  Note       Your browser asks to allow access to this computer the first
             time.
             After a web release it may ask you to update bonsai.
  Exposes    nothing to the internet; pages from the hosted app may call this
             computer through your browser





